import scene_objects.dl
import scene_uploads.dl
import shader_attachments.dl

class:
    patterns:
        UI scene ordered record
    members:
        record as UI scene shader instance
        span as an integer
        pipeline as an integer
        depth as a floating-point number

UI scene ordered records means: the type of (an empty list of UI scene ordered record)
UI scene draw buckets means: the type of (an empty list of UI scene shader instances)
UI scene shader draws means: the type of (an empty list of UI shader draw)

class:
    patterns:
        UI scene frame
    members:
        bank as a pointer to UI scene mesh bank
        records as UI scene shader instances
        draws as UI scene shader draws
        shadow records as UI scene shader instances
        shadow draws as UI scene shader draws
        buckets as UI scene draw buckets
        shadow buckets as UI scene draw buckets
        ordered as UI scene ordered records
        scratch as UI scene ordered records

to get [a UI scene frame using] {a pointer to UI scene mesh bank:bank}:
    set result to storage for one slot initialized with (a new UI scene frame)
    set result's bank to bank
    set result's records to an empty list of UI scene shader instance
    set result's draws to an empty list of UI shader draw
    set result's shadow records to an empty list of UI scene shader instance
    set result's shadow draws to an empty list of UI shader draw
    set result's buckets to an empty list of UI scene shader instances
    set result's shadow buckets to an empty list of UI scene shader instances
    set result's ordered to an empty list of UI scene ordered record
    set result's scratch to an empty list of UI scene ordered record
    return result

to get [the UI scene color pipelines]:
    set result to a new JSON-RPC array
    loop index from 0 to 16:
        set face to "cw" if (index & 1) != 0, else "ccw"
        set cull to "none" if (index & 2) != 0, else "back"
        set blend to "alpha" if (index & 4) != 0, else "opaque"
        add (a UI shader raster state culling cull facing face writing depth ((index & 8) = 0) comparing "less-equal" blending blend) to the JSON array result
    return result

to get [the UI scene shadow pipelines]:
    set result to a new JSON-RPC array
    loop index from 0 to 4:
        set face to "cw" if (index & 1) != 0, else "ccw"
        set cull to "none" if (index & 2) != 0, else "front"
        add (a UI shader raster state culling cull facing face writing depth true comparing "less-equal" blending "opaque") to the JSON array result
    return result

to [close UI scene frame] {a pointer to UI scene frame:frame}:
    free frame's records
    free frame's draws
    free frame's shadow records
    free frame's shadow draws
    for each bucket in (frame's buckets):
        free bucket
    free frame's buckets
    for each bucket in (frame's shadow buckets):
        free bucket
    free frame's shadow buckets
    free frame's ordered
    free frame's scratch
    destroy the value at frame
    deallocate frame
